## Baqueano Guide

The Baqueano Guide will be composed of a series of articles meant to provide the visitor with information on Bijagual and its surrounding areas. As the word _baqueano_ implies, this guide will attempt to contribute insight knowledge, particularly on its people, food, and natural resources, in order to fully experience BijaLapa Natural and its attractions.

